secure online payments and safeguard your kids’ online experience.</span></li><li>Sensitive data encryption&nbsp;<span class="eset-tooltip-element">Military-grade encryption of files, folders and external drives in case of USB or laptop loss. Enables secure collaboration and data sharing.</span></li><li>Password management&nbsp;<span class="eset-tooltip-element">Remember only one password to safely store and share all your passwords across devices.&nbsp;</span></li><li>Protection against new threats&nbsp;<span class="eset-tooltip-element">LiveGuard is a service personalized to you, designed to discover and stop never-before-seen types of threats.</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col col-sm-4 "><div id="content-eis-box" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="box skin-badge-invisible hover-normal skin-white border-1 border-gray-light opacity-100 "><div class="box-content "><div id="content-c8203581" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="csc-textpic csc-textpic-svg csc-textpic-center csc-textpic-above" data-filter-option="" data-filter-state="" data-filter-sync-name=""><div class="eset-svg-icon 0 color-none " style="padding: 0px 0px 10px 0px"><div class="svg-holder" style="width:115px; padding-bottom: 23.478260869565%"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 115.62 27.64"><path d="M115.61,7.48V2.32l-12.42-2.32-12.42,2.32V7.44c-.03,1.46,.04,14.43,11.87,19.94l.53,.26,.6-.25c11.83-5.52,11.88-18.45,11.85-19.91h-.01Zm-12.4,18.51c-10.92-5.13-10.98-17.16-10.95-18.55V3.56l10.92-2.04,10.92,2.04v3.94c.03,1.35-.01,13.37-10.9,18.48h.01Z" fill="#424d56" style="opacity: .3;"/><path d="M24.85,7.48V2.32L12.43,0,0,2.32V7.44c-.03,1.47,.04,14.44,11.88,19.94l.52,.26,.6-.25c11.83-5.52,11.88-18.45,11.85-19.91ZM12.45,26h0C1.53,20.86,1.48,8.83,1.51,7.45V3.58L12.43,1.54l10.92,2.04v3.94c.03,1.35,0,13.36-10.9,18.49h0Zm.61-1.53l-.63,.27-.63-.27C2.16,19.79,2.55,8.33,2.55,8.21v-3.8l9.88-1.91,9.88,1.91v3.8c0,.12,.39,11.59-9.25,16.27ZM70.