lass="content" id="content-pane-6834911" aria-labelledby="trigger-6834911" role="region"><div class="content-wrapper"><div id="content-c6834896" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="row flex skin-padding-m equal-element-height"><div class="col col-sm-4 "><div id="content-c6834891" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="box skin-badge-invisible hover-normal border-gray-light opacity-100 "><div class="box-content "><div id="content-c6834890" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><h4>Endpoint protection</h4><p class="description">Award-winning security for business computers and mobiles.<br /><br /></p><p class="description"><a href="/au/business/solutions/endpoint-protection/">Learn more<br /><br /></a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col col-sm-4 "><div id="content-c6834893" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="box skin-badge-invisible hover-normal border-gray-light opacity-100 "><div class="box-content "><div id="content-c6834892" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><h4>Identity &amp; data protection</h4><p class="description">Comply with data regulations thanks to our Encryption and Multi-Factor Authentication solutions.</p><p class="description"><a href="/au/business/solutions/identity-and-data-protection/">Learn more<br /><br /></a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col col-sm-4 "><div id="content-c6834895" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="box skin-badge-invisible hover-normal border-gray-light opacity-100 "><div class="box-content "><div id="content-c6834894" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><h4> Advanced threat defense</h4><p class="description">Detect new, never-before-seen types of threats such as ransomware by analyzing samples in a cloud sandbox.</p><p class="description"><a href="/au/business/solutions/advanced-threat-defense/">Learn more<br /><br /></a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="content-c6834903" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="row flex skin-padding-m equal-element-height"><div class="col col-sm-4 "><div id="content-c6834898" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="box skin-badge-invisible hover-normal border-gray-light opacity-100 "><div class="box-content "><div id="content-c6834897" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><h4>Cloud security</h4><p class="description">Advanced preventive protection for your Microsoft 365 cloud email and storage.</p><p class="description"><a href="/au/business/solutions/cloud-security/">Learn more<br /><br /></a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col col-sm-4 "><div id="content-c6834900" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="box skin-badge-invisible hover-normal border-gray-light opacity-100 "><div class="box-content "><div id="content-c6834899" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><h4>Extended detection &amp; response</h4><p class="description">Uncover the unknown threats in your network with ESET Inspect, the XDR-enabling component of the ESET PROTECT platform. </p><p class="description"><a href="/au/business/solutions/xdr-extended-detection-and-response/">Learn more<br /><br /></a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col col-sm-4 "><div id="content-c6834902" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="box skin-badge-invisible hover-normal border-gray-light opacity-100 "><div class="box-content "><div id="content-c6834901" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><h4>Mail security</h4><p class="description">Protect your users and their email, the most exploited threat vector.<br /><br /></p><p class="description"><a href="/au/business/solutions/mail-security/">Learn more</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="content-c6834910" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="row flex skin-padding-m equal-element-height"><div class="col col-sm-4 "><div id="content-c6834905" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="box skin-badge-invisible hover-normal border-gray-light opacity-100 "><div class="box-content "><div id="content-c6834904" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><h4>File server security</h4><p class="description">Protect your file servers, SharePoint or Gateway servers with multi-layered protection.<br /><br /></p><p class="description"><a href="/au/business/solutions/file-server-security/">Learn more<br /><br /></a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col col-sm-4 "><div id="content-c6834907" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="box skin-badge-invisible hover-normal border-gray-light opacity-100 "><div class="box-content "><div id="content-c6834906" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><h4>Security management</h4><p class="description">Single pane of glass over all security solutions deployed in the network with detection &amp; response layers across all platforms.</p><p class="description"><a href="/au/business/solutions/security-management/">Learn more<br /><br /></a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col col-sm-4 "><div id="content-c6834909" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><div class="box skin-badge-invisible hover-normal border-gray-light opacity-100 "><div class="box-content "><div id="content-c6834908" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default"><h4>ESET Services</h4><p class="description">Browse our security services such as Threat Hunting or our professional services like Deployment or Premium Support. </p><p class="description">Learn more</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="content-c6834815" class="section faded-opaque skin-inverse skin-border-top-b2c "><span class="rimg section-image hidden" data-remote=".section" data-viewport="all" data-bg-color="faded-black" data-src=""></span><div class="container" ><div class="section-content"><div id="content-enterprise" class="csc-frame csc-frame-default skin-mt-medium skin-mb-medium"><div class="csc-textpic-text"><h2 class="align-center">Enterprise</h2><h4 class="align-center">Endpoint security and services for busin